. estat ptrends                          // 事前平行趋势检验

Parallel-trends test (pretreatment time period)
H0: Linear trends are parallel

 F(1, 1) = 8.60e+06
Prob > F =   0.0002

. estat granger                          // Granger 型事前趋势检验

Granger causality test
H0: No effect in anticipation of treatment

 F(1, 1) = 22395.17
Prob > F =   0.0043

. estat grangerplot, ///
>     title("Granger causality plot") ///
>     scheme(s1mono)

